  <item>
    <title>074 如何度过火旺的夏天？从五行、星象、面相出发</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a0edbd9e1eb34a939d630f9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a0edbd9e1eb34a939d630f9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>hello呀，朋友们！有没有觉得最近很烦闷？今天来跟大家聊聊火旺～</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">01:13</a>&nbsp;火旺的常见症状：失眠、冒痘、易怒，别急着怪自己脾气差。</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">02:04</a>&nbsp;2026丙午年火上加火的能量背景，以及如何判断自己是否受影响。</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="203">03:23</a>&nbsp;5月星象解读：冥王星逆行、水星进双子等如何放大焦虑与冲突。</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="328">05:28</a>&nbsp;实用补水建议：多喝水、游泳、抄经、学会像水一样灵活应对。</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="605">10:05</a>&nbsp;面相信号：额头、印堂、鼻头长痘及嘴角下垂，揭示内在火旺。</span></p><p></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1009">16:49</a>&nbsp;“赤马红羊”历史寓意：压力即动力，驾驭火能带来质的飞跃。</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p><span>感谢大家！么么哒！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66ab90c2e622c243d87c4f2d/lmDyXxOwZSxDe_R3YHAkKBv39swZ.m4a" length="18580848" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:19:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fji_U1z_Y-pu6K27QUqlgLndwvQy.png"/>
